{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act27side_level_act27side_05_end",
  "groupId": "act27side",
  "stageId": "act27side_05",
  "title": "我會唱一首彩虹",
  "storyCode": "SL-5",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act27side/level_act27side_05_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "fe061c26a2cc67cf8fbbed899b4df5e1cc14d852bd1ac8e6602774a3ee6b0820",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "text": "呼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年邁的店主",
      "text": "你怎麼還在這？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "text": "在拿到你們所有人的簽字之前，我都要像一隻海灘上的四爪磐蟹一樣賴在這裡了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年邁的店主",
      "text": "好啊，那你賴著吧。我要收攤回家跟自己喝一杯了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "text": "您請便。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年邁的店主",
      "text": "今天我從那個集市上買到了個新鮮玩意，好像是叫什麼“源石微波按摩儀”，哥倫比亞的，弄不明白，但還挺好用，貼在腰上確實舒服。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "text": "嘗試一下新鮮事物也不是壞事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年邁的店主",
      "text": "長毛循獸騎著衝浪板在屋頂衝浪的那個節目也是你們搞的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "text": "長毛循獸？不，那個不是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年邁的店主",
      "text": "真可惜，我還蠻喜歡那個的。沒有了黑曜石音樂節之後，難得見到這麼有趣的節目。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "text": "很高興能取悅到您......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年邁的店主",
      "text": "對了，送你一個東西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "text": "......拇指琴？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "text": "這也是您從白天的集市上買來的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年邁的店主",
      "text": "新婚快樂，小子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年邁的店主",
      "text": "為了家人找了個穩定的工作，雖然是無聊了點，倒也算有責任心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年邁的店主",
      "text": "能理解你喜歡安定，可是生活的方式總有很多種，別讓自己過得太狼狽了，小子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "text": "人只要活著就夠狼狽了......隨遇而安吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年邁的店主",
      "text": "那時候和你爺爺打賭，說你總有一天能去黑曜石音樂節拿一個大獎回來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年邁的店主",
      "text": "真是......白瞎了那麼好的音樂天賦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "text": "等您有心情的時候，我也可以把舊吉他搬出來，再彈給您聽。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年邁的店主",
      "text": "要是你早拿出吉他彈上一曲，說不定我早就在那張表上簽字了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "text": "您......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "text": "謝謝。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "text": "哈莉太太，這裡丟的衝浪板我們幫您找回來了，您看看數量對不對。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "text": "非常抱歉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈莉",
      "text": "你幫了我的忙，怎麼反而跟我道歉？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "text": "這個......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈莉",
      "text": "這幾件東西，我還以為再也派不上用場了。真奇怪，到底是誰拿走的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "text": "唔，那個，我也不是很清楚......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈莉",
      "text": "沒事的，孩子，說不定是一些遊客玩得太開心順手拿去玩了玩，都找回來就行了。那你呢？你今天玩得開心嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "埃尼斯",
      "text": "是指被溫泉水澆個濕透嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈莉",
      "text": "也算是找回了一點在海邊玩水的感覺？好久沒這麼熱鬧過了，連來喝酒的客人臉上都是笑眯眯的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈莉",
      "text": "之前那幾個店主天天苦著一張臉，酒都變難喝了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "哈莉看向店外還沒有散去的遊客，夕陽漸漸染紅天空，每個人都很快樂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈莉",
      "text": "就像是回到了好幾年前啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "男人緩緩走向陳舊的咖啡館，又一次推開門。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他摸索著打開電閘，用抹布仔細將吧檯上的灰塵抹去，又從櫃子裡拿出器具，再從懷中摸出一包從辦公室帶回來的新鮮咖啡豆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "像許多年前一樣，燒水，磨粉，仔細注水。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "text": "呼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "text": "這味道......還是手生了啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他看向窗外，人們趁著夕陽陸陸續續回了家，街道漸漸趨於冷落，直到街上空無一人，他才發出一聲自嘲的苦笑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "text": "真是......我到底在等什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他喝完咖啡，準備收拾東西離開這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一陣敲門聲傳來。科斯達記得自己並沒有將店門關上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "text": "......誰？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "text": "晚上好......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "text": "請問，這裡還營業嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "text": "多利先生，你真的已經和小黑羊們說清楚了，不能再這樣搗亂了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "text": "嗯......再搗亂的話，我會否認他們是我的一部分。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷糊的生物",
      "text": "（在半空中打滾）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "著急的生物",
      "text": "（衝撞著街邊的牆）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "text": "......多利先生！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "text": "好吧，我會盡力的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷糊的生物",
      "text": "（試圖安靜地行走）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "text": "看，是不是好多了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "text": "可是今天的博覽會它們還是造成了不小的混亂......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "text": "可是空氣裡全都是快樂的味道，嗯，到現在都還是甜甜的。這種感覺就和我第一次在你們所說的“國家”之間行走的時候一樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "text": "多山的地區可以滑翔，有水的地區可以衝浪，荒野裡還有幾個煩人的崽子追著我到處跑，每個地方產出的東西也不一樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "text": "能看到這些有趣的事，對於你們這些並不能四處遊歷的人類來說，很新奇吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "text": "......為什麼感覺多利先生是在炫耀？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "text": "被發現了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "text": "那你今天玩得怎麼樣呢，阿黛爾？溫泉可以放鬆，滑板很刺激，來自那隻吵鬧企鵝的吵鬧音樂有沒有讓你覺得激動？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "text": "多利先生，那些小朋友們可是能看得到小羊的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "text": "唉，讓你高興起來，怎麼就這麼難呢？空氣中又出現了那種叫做“傷心”的又苦又澀的味道！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "阿黛爾轉過臉去偷偷笑了一下，隨即又正色起來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "text": "多利先生，我們到了。我要和店主先生留張紙條說明一下，展品已經找到了，辛苦他為我們留心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "text": "紙和筆都在包裡......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "text": "欸，這家咖啡店......是又開業了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "昏黃的燈光充溢在房間裡，透過窗子，咖啡店中的陳設微茫可見。\n科斯達將熱水傾倒出來，聲音劃破他與客人之間的沉默。\n水氣漫上窗子，阿黛爾輕輕拭去玻璃上溫泉吹來的白霧，她終於看清了那位客人的模樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "text": "怎麼停下了？我們不是要進去喝咖啡嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "text": "......凱勒老師？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "text": "《泰拉火山圖志》我收到了，沒想到你居然妥善保管了這麼多年......謝謝。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "text": "啊，是我託一個小姑娘還回去的。她來這裡找一個什麼展品，正好是火山博物館的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "text": "那個，她是你的員工嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "text": "阿黛爾是我的學生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "text": "啊，你的學生。嗯，嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "text": "你最近......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "text": "......狼狽的市政廳的職員，正在收集這裡居民在搬遷意向書上的簽字。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "text": "這裡還有我父母留下來的一小間服裝店，按理說，我也需要在意向書上簽字。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "text": "那你......對這裡的改建有什麼異議嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "text": "很早之前家裡就不再靠這個維生了。如果這能方便你的工作的話......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "text": "當然，謝謝配合......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "text": "要來一杯咖啡嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "text": "那還能提供以前的聊天服務嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "text": "作為一個合格的咖啡師，傾聽也是工作的一部分。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "text": "那，請坐吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "text": "要不我們走吧，多利先生？今天看來不是很適合留言了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "text": "啊，可是咖啡很香，我們不喝咖啡嗎......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "著急的生物",
      "text": "（準備一頭衝進咖啡廳）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "text": "欸......欸！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "關上的玻璃門阻擋住了小羊的撞擊，它也並未像想像中那樣發出巨大的聲音，它只是向後旋轉著彈飛出去，滾落在街上。\n阿黛爾緊張地觀察著店內兩人的反應。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "text": "當時為什麼突然就走了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "text": "我遇到了兩個......很有趣的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "text": "想要研究火山，總要去更多地方看看。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "text": "我記得，你們那時候常常在這裡碰面。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "text": "嗯，只要他倆來店裡，你就會把吉他插上電，開始你吵鬧的重金屬表演。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "text": "瑪格娜一直感覺“咖啡店裡的那個小男孩”，好像有點不太歡迎他們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "text": "啊......我那時候，就是有點太隨心所欲了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "text": "也不是針對他們......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "text": "我知道。他們也沒有放在心上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "text": "那時你給他們嚐咖啡氣泡水，還讓我們給你保密，不要告訴知更鳥爺爺。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "text": "爺爺一點都看不上我那些自創飲料，我在菜單上加上幾次他就要擦掉幾次......他覺得那和我的電吉他、爵士鼓一樣奇怪。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "text": "順便一提，那可不是普通的咖啡氣泡水，它的名字是“火山咖啡”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "text": "好，好，是“火山咖啡”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "text": "不過確實挺好喝的，我們去了萊塔尼亞以後，卡提亞還常常按照你的配方，自己復刻那種風味呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "text": "卡提亞......和瑪格娜......他們現在怎麼樣了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "text": "我記得，你在離開汐斯塔時說過，你會和他們一起走遍大地上的每一座火山。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "text": "在旅程中，我與他們同行了很久。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "text": "......但是幾年前，我和他們走散了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "text": "走散？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "text": "而且我們永遠無法重逢了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "text": "是因為......？我很抱歉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "text": "所以我回到這裡，開始建那座博物館，希望能保留下他們當年所研究的一切。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "text": "那天，在博物館遇見你，完全......完全出乎我的意料。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "text": "我也很意外，你和我印象裡的那個吵小孩也完全不一樣了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "text": "你也是......你現在都已經是博物館的館長了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "text": "嗯，算是實現了曾經的理想吧。只不過，支撐我做下去的信念，和最開始又有一些不同了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "text": "不過，改變不完全是個壞事，不是嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "兩人沉默了一會兒，客人輕輕攪動著杯中的咖啡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "text": "你去了今天的博覽會嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "text": "博覽會？我去了。遊客多了起來，店主們都很開心，好像之前的汐斯塔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "text": "或許等這個地方重建好，等遊客多起來，我對我的以後也會有一點新想法了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "text": "比如？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "text": "誰知道呢......？可能繼續開一家咖啡店，但是是搖滾咖啡店，或者就是樂器店，在裡面擺滿爵士鼓和電吉他。總會有人喜歡這些的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "text": "就像你說的......就像之前的汐斯塔那樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "text": "對了，今天還有一件很有意思的事，我在那個商品博覽會上，見到了一種來自哥倫比亞的飲料，配方和“火山咖啡”一模一樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "text": "可不是我把你的秘方洩露出去的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "text": "不是不是，在一年前打算關停這家店的時候，我也跟別人說過“火山咖啡”的做法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "text": "但其實......也就是咖啡加蘇打水罷了。當然也有可能是哥倫比亞人自己發明的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "text": "手沖咖啡加蘇打水，你當時是怎麼想到的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "text": "小時候覺得咖啡那麼苦，肯定要加點什麼才能喝得下去啊......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "text": "會在店裡大彈搖滾樂的人居然也會怕苦啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "text": "那個時候哪裡會在意這些事啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "凱勒笑了起來，喝光了最後一口咖啡，香氣在店內縈繞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "text": "那這一杯，還要加點蘇打水嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "text": "好啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱勒",
      "text": "不過喝完這一杯，恐怕今晚真的要睡不著覺了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "text": "阿黛爾，我先說明一下，我告訴過他們了，可是他們幾個現在就是很想進這家店，可能是想嚐一嚐火山咖啡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "text": "為了彌補店主的損失，我可以留下一個今天博覽會上的商品作為交換！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "text": "......博覽會的商品？是哪裡來的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "text": "一個可愛的小孩子送給我的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "text": "真的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "text": "唉！現在不能進店裡！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "著急的生物",
      "text": "（拱進角落）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷糊的生物",
      "text": "（掀翻箱子）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "不安分的小羊從阿黛爾身邊的雜物中拖出了一箱玻璃瓶，興致勃勃地翻找著什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "最終，它們銜著幾枚從汽水瓶上掰下來的金屬瓶蓋，一副如獲至寶的樣子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "text": "......幹什麼？你們不是為了喝汽水嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "小羊們蹦蹦跳跳，每一隻都頂著一枚亮閃閃的瓶蓋，排成一隊，玩鬧著跑向遠方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "text": "唉，都說了等一等，他們怎麼比我還著急？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "text": "那是......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "text": "哦，這就是他們想找的“種子”！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "text": "這些瓶蓋......為什麼會是種子？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "text": "他們眼裡的世界，和你們看到的是不太一樣的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "text": "這一粒粒小小圓圓的東西，被羽獸帶去了異國他鄉，生根發芽，變成了截然不同的樣子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "text": "有的成了汽水的蓋子，有的成了醬料的蓋子，每一種的味道都不一樣，但又都各自有趣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "text": "大概他們中有的在哥倫比亞喝過這種火山咖啡，所以印象深刻吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "text": "這種看待世界的視角，難道不夠有趣嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "被落下的生物",
      "text": "（刨土）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿黛爾",
      "text": "可就算是這樣......唉，你們把瓶蓋埋進地裡也不會長出飲料的呀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "text": "隨他們去吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "text": "答案會自己長出來的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "text": "喂，我是科斯達。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話裡的聲音",
      "text": "科斯達先生，我是您祖父的護理醫生。我很抱歉，您的祖父，今天傍晚去世了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話裡的聲音",
      "text": "不知道該不該說是種安慰，他走得很安詳。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科斯達",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
